# Stack declaration

This repository uses the **`nextjs-supabase`** configuration pack.

- **Manifest:** `.cursor/stack.json` (technologies, rule lists, template repo path)
- **Patterns:** `nextjs-supabase-patterns.mdc` when changing routing, auth, or Supabase access
- **Shared templates:** `pokomaru-cell/cursor-dev-templates` → `stacks/nextjs-supabase`

## Assumed stack

Next.js **16** App Router (`proxy.ts`, not legacy `middleware.ts`) · React 19 · Supabase (`@supabase/ssr`, Postgres **RLS**, `getUser()`) · Zod · shadcn/ui · Tailwind 4 · npm

Do not introduce a separate REST API layer, service-role Supabase client, or Pages Router patterns unless the user explicitly approves.
